# Pain for All can't enchant Bot2's Raging Goblin. On Bot1's Grizzly Bears (2/2) its enters ability has the Bears deal 2 to the first
# Goblin (a 1/1, so it dies) rather than to a player. The Bears attack and the second Goblin and a Memnite (1/1 each) block together:
# their 1 + 1 damage is dealt at once, so the Aura triggers once (one item on the stack) and the Bears deal that much, 2, to Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Grizzly Bears
Pain for All
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Mox Sapphire
Raging Goblin x2
Memnite
Island x14

